#: usermanager/templates/usermanager/email/confirm_subscription.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Hi!\n"
"\n"
"Someone, hopefully you, asked to subscribe this address to Bracho's "
"newsletter. To confirm, open this link within %(days)s days:"
msgstr ""
"¡Hola!\n"
"\n"
"Alguien, esperemos que tú, ha pedido suscribir esta dirección a la "
"newsletter de Bracho. Para confirmarlo, abre este enlace en los próximos "
"%(days)s días:"

#: usermanager/templates/usermanager/email/confirm_subscription.txt:7
msgid ""
"If it wasn't you, just ignore this email: unconfirmed addresses never "
"receive the newsletter."
msgstr ""
"Si no fuiste tú, ignora este correo: las direcciones sin confirmar nunca "
"reciben la newsletter."

#: usermanager/views.py:35
msgid "We couldn't send you the confirmation email. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"No pudimos enviarte el correo de confirmación. Inténtalo de nuevo más tarde."

#: usermanager/views.py:39
msgid "Almost there! Check your inbox and confirm your subscription."
msgstr "¡Ya casi está! Revisa tu correo y confirma tu suscripción."

#: usermanager/views.py:43
msgid ""
"We were unable to subscribe you to your newsletter. Something went wrong."
msgstr "No pude suscribirte a tu boletín informativo. Algo salió mal."

#: usermanager/views.py:64
msgid ""
"This confirmation link is invalid or has expired. Subscribe again to get a "
"new one."
msgstr ""
"Este enlace de confirmación no es válido o ha caducado. Suscríbete de nuevo "
"para recibir otro."

#: usermanager/views.py:68
msgid "Your subscription is confirmed. Thank you!"
msgstr "Tu suscripción está confirmada. ¡Gracias!"

#: usermanager/views.py:81
msgid "Confirm your subscription to Bracho"
msgstr "Confirma tu suscripción a Bracho"
